{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53400","headline":"登石伞峰 · 王承邺","name":"登石伞峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"作镇得良牧，抚戎慙匪仁。\n每观龚黄化，煦物如阳春。\n政简似多暇，游从邀衆宾。\n鸣驺镜水畔，舍櫂耶溪津。\n偶兹逢胜境，顿觉离嚣尘。\n丞相筑室在，季方结庐新。\n登临经绝顶，瞩眺怡心神。\n金章照玉伞，龙节陵松鳞。\n笙歌入中流，声角闻城闉。\n更吟琼瑶篇，愿言书诸绅。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷四）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王承邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53400.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53400","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}